--- story 1: proposer P1 alone, value A ---
    0 ms  P1: prepare(11) for value A
    5 ms  a1: promises ballot 11, has accepted nothing
    5 ms  a2: promises ballot 11, has accepted nothing
    5 ms  a3: promises ballot 11, has accepted nothing
   10 ms  P1: majority promised; free to propose its own value A
   15 ms  a1: accepts (11, A)
   15 ms  a2: accepts (11, A)
   15 ms      >>> value A is CHOSEN (ballot 11, majority of acceptors)
   15 ms  a3: accepts (11, A)
   20 ms  P1: majority accepted ballot 11: knows that A is chosen
chosen: value A in ballot 11
safety: ok, at most one value chosen

--- story 2: P1 proposes A; later P2 proposes B ---
    0 ms  P1: prepare(11) for value A
    5 ms  a1: promises ballot 11, has accepted nothing
    5 ms  a2: promises ballot 11, has accepted nothing
   10 ms  P1: majority promised; free to propose its own value A
   15 ms  a1: accepts (11, A)
   15 ms  a2: accepts (11, A)
   15 ms      >>> value A is CHOSEN (ballot 11, majority of acceptors)
   20 ms  P1: majority accepted ballot 11: knows that A is chosen
   30 ms  P2: prepare(12) for value B
   35 ms  a1: promises ballot 12, reports accepted (11, A)
   35 ms  a2: promises ballot 12, reports accepted (11, A)
   35 ms  a3: promises ballot 12, has accepted nothing
   40 ms  a3: ignores prepare(11), already promised 12
   40 ms  P2: majority promised; must adopt value A (accepted in ballot 11)
   45 ms  a1: accepts (12, A)
   45 ms  a2: accepts (12, A)
   45 ms      >>> value A is CHOSEN (ballot 12, majority of acceptors)
   45 ms  a3: accepts (12, A)
   50 ms  a3: ignores accept(11, A), promised 12
   50 ms  P2: majority accepted ballot 12: knows that A is chosen
chosen: value A in ballot 11
chosen: value A in ballot 12
safety: ok, at most one value chosen
